            "review_title": "Review at Mi Quang Ba Mua",
            "review_text": "hk-san\nTokyo Prefecture, Japan609 contributions\n0\nMeek Wan at the Beautiful Shop\nAug 2024 • Solo\nWhen I went there around 11:00 on weekdays, there was only a pair of customers and it was very empty.\nThis place is famous for its meekwan, so I asked for one at the top of the menu and it came out in a hot pot. I didn't really know how to eat it, but the soup was delicious. I wasn't sure if I was going to put noodles and soup in it because the dishes came with it, or if it was a bowl for meat bones. Someone who came after me (maybe from Vietnam?) I used to eat noodles and pickled vegetables in a dish.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from Japanese\nShow original\nWritten August 30, 2024",
